 :root-cause
 "Verified-authoritative dispatch selected the generated indexed state machine only for roots classified as recursive-SCC-dependent. Acyclic roots still used the handwritten optimized Clojure/ClojureScript engine, while the Dafny AcyclicForward/AcyclicReverse functions projected the semantic relation rather than refining that complete host algorithm. The mode therefore could not support a complete generated-authority claim."
 :fix
 "Route every permission root through generated indexed traversal in verified-authoritative mode, run the generated alternate for every valid acyclic root in shadow mode, retain the optimized acyclic host path only for legacy and shadow-primary execution, normalize algorithm-private cursor representations to their result EID during cross-algorithm shadow comparison, and compare logical resource counters only when both sides run the same traversal algorithm."
 :closing-evidence
 ["eacl.formal.state-trace-differential-test/generated-mode-routes-and-does-not-reorder-acyclic-multipath-pages"
